## Commands

```bash
npm install
npm run desktop         # production build + Electron window
npm run desktop:dev     # Vite + Electron hot reload
npm run desktop:pack    # Windows installer + portable under release/
npm run dev             # browser-only (playtest / debug)
npm run verify          # lint + tests + build
npm run playtest        # autonomous smoke (Chromium)
npm run mp-server       # multiplayer relay :8787
```

## Layout

```
electron/     main process, preload, desktop:dev launcher
src/game/     all simulation + content + UI
playtest/     Playwright eyes/hands
server/       mp-server.mjs
docs/         PARITY, ARCHITECTURE, DECISIONS
release/      electron-builder output (gitignored)
```


## Invariants

1. `npm run verify` green before delivery  
2. Content integrity tests pass  
3. Save v4 + migrate older slots  
4. Playtest bridge only with `?playtest=1`  
5. No TODOs/stubs (SOUL §1)

